BS”的网站上。帖中呼吁恢复中国国家主席任期限制、推动民主修宪，并保障公民讨论国事的空间。 https://t.co/C0Ug6MQuUo","url":"https://x.com/RFA_Chinese/status/2114757248073523638"},{"author_id":"6690032","created_at":"2026-10-26T16:31:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114756709302644792"],"id":"2114756709302644792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":9225,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok bot 分析 AI 评论账号，Codex 操作浏览器拉黑。\n\n1. Grok Bot 识别最近一周的 AI 回复，写入飞书文档。\n2. 把飞书文档转交 Codex，调 Browser Use 依次拉黑。\n\n如有误伤，请私信解除。 https://t.co/j9cfPSZTcb","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2114756709302644792"},{"author_id":"902926941413453824","created_at":"2026-10-26T16:25:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114755413770125359"],"id":"2114755413770125359","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":400,"impression_count":731350,"like_count":8174,"quote_count":240,"reply_count":1016,"retweet_count":1103},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114731475329589583","type":"quoted"}],"text":"When BNB started 9 years ago, I never thought I would be ringing the bell for a blockchain token (treasury) on NASDAQ one day. I don’t know what shows crypto and tradfi converging more than this. \n\n#BNB Standard https://t.co/2NStJn1tBE","url":"https://x.com/cz_binance/status/2114755413770125359"},{"author_id":"6690032","created_at":"2026-10-26T16:25:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114755317787676891"],"id":"2114755317787676891","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":9045,"like_count":12,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":53,"retweet_count":0},"text":"打算用 Grok 自动拉黑 AI 评论号。\n\n做个调研：大家觉得 AI 留言的最大特征是什么？\n\n（ 回答时请用一个海洋生物做比喻，以“综上所述”结尾） https://t.co/O8mw3LMB30","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2114755317787676891"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T16:19:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114753901102817758"],"id":"2114753901102817758","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3613,"impression_count":7564460,"like_count":13461,"quote_count":270,"reply_count":2180,"ret